Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:04.26,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,And pretend that it isn't there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:10.39,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's pile up all the dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:16.69,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,and go find the thing we're looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:19.94,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,A pocket of coins, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:31.05,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:39.63,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's break the tight-fisted night!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:45.17,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,We have no interest in treasure chests
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:48.64,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,A pocket of romance, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:58.58,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:04.60,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's pile up all the dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.26,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,And go find the thing we're looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:14.30,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,A pocket of coins, and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.64,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:27.18,We Are Remix lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are!
