Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:34.28,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,0)}黎明到來！\N草帽海賊團的終極攻擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:36.81,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,太厲害了，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:39.02,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你打倒了奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.05,0:02:50.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，魯夫！撐住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:51.77,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:54.99,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們把他逼到這種地步...他沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:58.06,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他肯定已經精疲力盡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:02.56,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他用一個人的身體承受了100人的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:06.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，我們得趕快奪回所有受害者的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:07.14,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:08.20,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.34,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,東邊的天空越來越亮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.61,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,隨時都會天亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:17.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,話說回來，要怎樣才能拿回影子？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.23,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們有4個夥伴的影子也被奪走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:27.05,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,那是另一個問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:31.16,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,老實說，我們本來想讓\N草帽替我們做這件事，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:35.12,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那不可能了，他現在連動都動不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:38.43,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,只有莫利亞這個殭屍所擁有的所有影子的主人才能做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:44.80,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,除非他下達「回到原來的主人身邊」的命令，否則影子不會回來。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:47.02,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,別廢話了，動手吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:47.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:51.24,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們去叫醒莫利亞，逼他下達命令。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:54.65,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,如果不奪回影子，那打倒他就沒有意義了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:11.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,奧⋯奧茲又站起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:16.47,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我以為那招足以讓他失去意識了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.94,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,太糟了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:21.50,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,全完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:24.71,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,草帽海賊團現在全員失去意識了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.56,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們已經用完了手上所有的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:32.38,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們沒有任何東西可以打倒他了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.64,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,一點都不痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:39.12,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:43.12,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,看來我們果然不是殭屍力量的對手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.81,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們沒有時間了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:46.41,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,天快亮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:50.08,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們永遠無法從黑暗中解脫了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,放棄吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.80,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,留在這裡只有死路一條。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.67,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回森林裡去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:05:00.65,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回到...那片看不到光的陰暗森林裡去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:04.57,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.37,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我不知道魯夫發生了什麼事，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:10.02,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們現在佔上風。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:11.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂⋯喂！等一下，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:13.43,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你這種狀態再動的話會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:17.14,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他挨了那種怪物的攻擊...怎麼還站得起來？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:19.73,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我都分不清誰才是殭屍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:29.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，我們救出來的草帽海賊團的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.02,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,別問我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:34.71,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們昏迷的時候不可能自己移動吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.94,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,嗯，另外兩個人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.03,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你⋯你說得對！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:40.32,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,長鼻子和那個女人都不見了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:43.23,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們...先跑了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.13,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,嗯，全部人都不見了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.06,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們什麼時候...？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:55.16,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,看⋯看來還不夠。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.47,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,嗯，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:59.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂喂，連你也是，草帽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.19,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我只要再給他一拳就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:02.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.81,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我之前消耗太大了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.31,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:06.98,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.25,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:10.75,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們沒有逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.20,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我得上到那裡去。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.21,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,收到。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.84,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,那麼...我來做你的踏板。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:21.57,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,如果有什麼我能幫忙的...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.86,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,連那個只剩骨頭的也在動！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:26.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好，布魯克，我有個請求！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:31.40,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我就知道會這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:36.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,大家都準備好支援你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:38.20,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,之前那個女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.54,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,她怎麼在那裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:44.06,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,難道說這些傢伙...！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:46.40,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,從一開始就沒打算逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:49.67,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,從奧茲站起來的那一刻...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:52.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們就開始計劃反擊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:55.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,看好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.64,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喬巴，快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:00.68,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,太陽快出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:01.42,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:04.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你需要的是這個嗎，佛朗基？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:05.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,夠了，現在來幫我一把！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:08.74,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,真不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:11.77,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,這些傢伙從來就沒想過放棄！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:13.83,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，你擋路了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:14.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:17.60,Main,Pirates,0,0,0,,遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.80,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}腿花...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.80,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}腿之花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.90,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:27.73,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.88,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:36.97,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你要去哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.55,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:43.91,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,煙？雲？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:46.38,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,天氣預報是雨。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.61,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}冷氣泡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.10,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}下雨節拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.44,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,下雨了！怎麼會？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.74,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那個女孩是魔術師嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.43,0:08:03.54,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:06.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,緊急水管完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:08.17,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,可惡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.90,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}風來噴射！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.24,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,什麼...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,用盡全力旋轉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:17.94,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:25.83,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:29.09,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}超級冰箱急凍砲...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:33.16,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:43.82,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我被凍住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:46.32,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.36,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:51.22,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們用它來凍結雨水！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.65,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這次輪到我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:56.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:03.70,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,鎖鏈？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.01,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:09.66,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,舵的鎖鏈？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:11.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你太厲害了，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:12.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,小意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:14.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,把我扔上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.25,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你確定嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:19.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒問題的，我可是橡膠人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:21.39,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:23.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.22,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}骨氣球！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:34.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.22,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,對付奧茲的腹部！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:38.52,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:40.22,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}奧義...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.12,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三千世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:54.90,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:57.04,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.66,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,幹得好，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,奧茲的脊椎已經完全伸直了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:06.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們在做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:15.31,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,人類的脊椎呈S形，\N是為了緩解衝擊和重量的影響。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:22.60,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,如果被拉直，力量就無法分散，所有傷害都會直接承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.39,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,上吧，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:28.44,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,祝你好運！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.91,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我給你一發超大號火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:36.12,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,那我就用自己的火箭炮來反擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.87,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:39.45,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,嗯？動不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:42.07,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我的右臂動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:43.55,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,也伸不長！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:47.24,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,感覺不到疼痛才是殭屍最大的弱點。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:48.62,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他是你的影子...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:49.93,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,給他最後一擊吧，魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:52.13,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.16,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:57.77,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,打倒他，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.33,Main,Both,0,0,0,,注意了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:01.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨人...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:24.58,Main,All,0,0,0,,他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:35.84,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,不管是什麼殭屍，挨了那一招都不可能再站起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:38.00,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,奧茲輸了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:39.80,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,這次是真的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.58,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark接下來會怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.77,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他們做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.73,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他們真了不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:02.30,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,看來我帶了些危險人物來啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.61,0:12:05.84,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.61,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,我們的主人在哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:09.88,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:13.16,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,這次是真的贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:14.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:15.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,太感謝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.71,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你是最棒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.99,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不愧是我們的希望之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.92,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,果然沒有辜負我們的期望！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:24.27,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,草帽在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.25,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,一個小矮人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:30.96,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.46,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你怎麼縮小了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:38.57,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,不痛，但是動不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:44.04,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,骨頭都碎了還醒著。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.43,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這種力量到底要怎麼玩弄生命啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,早晨的太陽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:06.16,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:09.17,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,這股不安是怎麼回事...？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:12.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:15.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快拿回你的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:17.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不是慶祝的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:19.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這裡的人可能會全部消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:20.53,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他說得對！我們得快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:26.35,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,快去揍醒那個莫利亞，\N讓他把我們所有人的影子還回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:29.05,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,早晨的太陽快升起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.37,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,不需要...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:33.86,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,把我打醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:38.21,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,莫利亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.52,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:43.85,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,太好了，你沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:47.21,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,莫利亞大人不可能那麼容易倒下的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:54.53,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你⋯你醒了就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:14:01.66,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,現在...如果你不想再被草帽海賊團打敗的話，就把我們所有人的影子還回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:03.82,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,對，還回來，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:10.49,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這不是兒戲。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:13.90,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,真正的海賊是不會被這種話威脅的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:19.78,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,如果你們這些森林裡的野狗在背後搞鬼的話，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:22.94,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,草帽力量暴增的謎底也就解開了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:28.18,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,想到你們利用了我的影子能力，\N真是令人不快！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:29.98,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:31.45,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,把影子還回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:37.69,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,草帽，你竟敢破壞我的Thriller Bark？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:41.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,搞亂我們旅程的是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.59,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,在太陽升起之前把影子還回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:47.94,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你們以現在的狀態繼續旅行的話，\N只有死路一條！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:50.70,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你們在新世界一分鐘都撐不下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:54.77,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你確實聚集了些厲害的手下，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.39,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你會失去他們所有人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:59.80,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你知道為什麼嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:03.11,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，草帽，現在不是閒聊的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.53,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,看看天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:06.04,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,越來越亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:08.10,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快奪回影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:11.39,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,沒有時間了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:14.88,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我從親身經歷中找到了答案！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:19.73,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,為什麼我那些優秀的手下在出名之後都離我而去了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:23.63,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我失去夥伴是因為他們是活人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:27.68,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,如果他們從一開始就是不死的殭屍，就不會失去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:29.34,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,殭屍是不死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:32.98,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,無限量的士兵可以隨時替換！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:37.84,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我要用這支不死軍團再次奪取海賊王的稱號！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:43.72,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你應該感恩你的影子被選中成為我的手下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:56.58,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,有什麼東西黏住我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:06.73,Thoughts,Moria,0,0,0,,就是現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:10.41,Thoughts,Moria,0,0,0,,聽好了，Thriller Bark的影子們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.87,Thoughts,Moria,0,0,0,,與我的力量合而為一吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:16.65,Note,Moria,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}阿斯嘉特：北歐神話中眾神和英靈的天國居所
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:16.65,Thoughts,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}影子的阿斯嘉特！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:19.97,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:24.40,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他的影子被奪走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:31.61,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,影子在...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:32.74,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:37.21,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他正在收集整個島上的影子並吸收它們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:40.78,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:45.48,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你承受住了100個影子，對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.62,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那我就能承受...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:47.95,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,200！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.97,0:16:53.29,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,300！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:55.18,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,600！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:02.37,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,700！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:09.51,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,1000個影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.63,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,全完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:18.68,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那到底是什麼東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:19.95,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我恢復正常了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:23.40,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快天亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.40,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,連草帽用了100個影子都打不倒奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:29.02,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但十倍的量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:33.51,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,原來使用者本人能承受更多的數量嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:35.77,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,完⋯完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.40,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,接下來會怎樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:43.19,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這不可能是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.05,0:17:47.48,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他把草帽的影子也吸收了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:53.89,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:55.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們毫無勝算！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:59.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂喂喂喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:10.32,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他在撕裂這個島！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:13.51,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,桅杆大宅要倒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.16,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:21.47,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,往森林裡跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.74,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這次真的完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.01,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我在消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.06,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我的身體在消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.93,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,誰來救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:35.23,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,笨蛋！快躲到陰影裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:36.39,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,陽光快照到我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,從陰影處走到森林去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:39.70,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不要離開宅邸的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:42.24,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蘿拉船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.34,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你在做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:44.89,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:47.30,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你們先走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:50.09,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你在說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:52.04,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你要跟我們一起走！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.23,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我才是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:58.18,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,這場賭注的負責人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:00.23,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你看那邊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.92,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他們...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:05.01,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那些傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:08.10,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,一步都沒有移動。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:13.46,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,他們的影子也被奪走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.79,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.38,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他們還認為自己能贏嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:19.15,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但他一拳就摧毀了半個島。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,莫利亞現在的力量超過了奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.56,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,既然他們都還沒放棄...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.55,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我也不會從這裡移動。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:34.86,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,如果我們一直把他們稱為「希望之光」卻在第一個困難出現時就拋棄他們，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:37.83,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,那我們不過是一群蛆蟲。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:39.52,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但以我們目前的情況...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.17,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你們先逃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:45.50,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,作為你們的船長，我保證會守護你們的榮譽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:50.09,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你們...只要好好活著就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.42,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蘿拉船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.13,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,光照到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:56.24,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快躲到陰影裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.40,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,沒關係！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:04.38,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,這就是把希望託付給他人的意義！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.80,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蘿拉船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:06.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不會吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.29,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你想死嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:11.66,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,生或死。只有一個答案！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:14.26,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,哪個都無所謂。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:18.33,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我不要回到黑暗中去！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:21.60,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.02,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,情況越來越糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.81,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他完全失控了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:32.75,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,是他的憤怒和愚蠢的自尊在助長他的瘋狂。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:36.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，大家，我們沒有時間了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:38.45,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,接下來要拚一把了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:40.38,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！靠你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:41.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,打倒他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.31,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:45.23,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你還能有什麼希望？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:46.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你不可能贏的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:49.66,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,對手可是擁有1000人力量的怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:50.21,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:51.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,好好想想吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:53.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他吸收了你們所有人的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:56.14,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那怪物比你強太多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.14,0:20:57.60,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,而且，我們已經沒有時間了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:21:00.55,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,如果你們不想被牽連，就在那裡看著吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:04.37,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,在這場與莫利亞的戰鬥中，我們已經佔了上風。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.31,0:21:07.64,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,但是，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:10.91,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,在天亮之前贏是完全另一回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:15.18,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,莫利亞已經超越了自己的極限來爭取時間。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:22.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:29.89,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,是我們先被消滅？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.22,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,還是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:33.09,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,莫利亞先自我毀滅？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:44.03,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射火箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:50.26,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.46,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,影子出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:58.49,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:08.32,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,一個接一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:11.01,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那些影子不是應該受他控制的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:14.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,莫利亞越是失去意識，他的控制就越差！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:19.22,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,即使是莫利亞，也不可能控制1000個影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.57,0:22:24.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:27.81,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}磚塊蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.44,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黑匣子！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.97,0:22:38.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我被困住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:41.92,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:47.73,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,正面命中！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:49.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,劈開島嶼的那一拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:51.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:22:58.24,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.59,0:23:03.33,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這就是你的洗禮！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:12.67,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這就是你們這些想在這片海上逞強的業餘小子的下場！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:19.84,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,這就是對抗七武海的下場！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:23.71,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,認清你在這個世界上的位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:28.52,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,出頭的釘子就會被敲回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.48,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,魯夫先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:35.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:41.67,Main,All,0,0,0,,他又站起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:46.51,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我才不管什麼業餘...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:50.58,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,還是什麼出頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.99,0:23:52.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,沒有人...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:54.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:23:56.05,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,壓垮我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:23:59.13,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,沒有人能壓垮你？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.12,0:24:06.06,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你說出這種毫無根據的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:08.76,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,恰恰證明了你有多缺乏經{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:12.06,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,因為我是橡膠做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:21.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要讓你把所有影子都吐出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.25,0:24:23.68,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他到底是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.68,0:24:24.54,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他是不死之身嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:25.88,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:30.06,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,陽光！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.06,0:24:31.25,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.25,0:24:33.28,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蠢貨！快回到陰影裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:34.20,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你們會消失的！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:35.34,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:36.85,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我的手...在消散！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:37.79,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,躲到陰影裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:40.26,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這整個地方都是死亡區域！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.35,0:24:46.57,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}骨氣球！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:52.41,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！那招也一起用沒問題嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.41,0:24:53.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼可能沒問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:59.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你忘了光是二檔就會讓身體損耗嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.01,0:25:01.11,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,別逞強了，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:06.00,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你的身體...會撐不住的！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.03,0:25:11.57,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.80,0:25:13.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨人...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.80,0:25:17.71,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射砲彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.15,0:25:22.77,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,好強大！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:24.50,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,影子出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.91,0:25:30.47,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我不會...讓我的軍隊逃走的！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:36.83,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.83,0:25:41.23,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我是你們的主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.25,0:25:43.72,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,那混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.72,0:25:45.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他不讓影子離開！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.89,0:25:47.39,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.63,0:25:50.39,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,回到我身邊來！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.39,0:25:51.33,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蘿拉船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.33,0:25:53.63,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蘿拉船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.63,0:25:57.94,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你聽得到嗎，影子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.87,0:26:01.84,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我們從出生起就一直在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.21,0:26:06.08,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我們一起來到這個世界的！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.59,0:26:08.61,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,拜託你回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.61,0:26:13.09,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,整整三年，我一直在尋找囚禁你的那個殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:15.52,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,現在你就在我眼前，不是嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:18.22,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,如果你聽得到，拜託回來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.22,0:26:19.36,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,拜託回來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.36,0:26:20.70,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,蘿拉船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.57,0:26:23.66,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快躲到牆壁的陰影裡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.66,0:26:25.86,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你的身體會消失的！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.86,0:26:28.82,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,但是...太殘酷了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.82,0:26:30.37,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,好不容易終於找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.34,0:26:33.57,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,確實如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.57,0:26:37.31,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,現在，我們所有人的影子都在莫利亞體內！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.31,0:26:42.35,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們不會再有這樣的機會了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.35,0:26:44.65,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,可惜，對手是七武海。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:47.39,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,是的，回來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.39,0:26:50.09,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回到我身邊來吧，影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.31,0:26:51.66,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.66,0:26:53.36,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.36,0:26:55.29,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.29,0:26:58.32,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.32,0:27:02.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我也有話想對我的影子說。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:09.51,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果你那麼想成為海賊王的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,就快點...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.36,0:27:16.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,回到我身邊來！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.81,0:27:52.45,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,草帽，你這傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.45,0:27:54.08,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:27:58.62,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你會明白的...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:28:03.46,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,在新世界...你會面對真正的噩夢！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.46,0:28:06.14,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,在新世界...！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.42,0:28:15.07,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,影子回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.91,0:28:30.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂⋯喂，大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.26,0:28:34.29,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.36,0:28:39.31,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,影子！快...！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.80,0:28:42.16,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,來不及了！
